    "body": "The issue in the `embed-resource` crate regarding spurious build failures doesn't sound very good.\r\n\r\nSomething like this snippet should suffice without `embed-resource`:\r\n```suggestion\r\n    #[cfg(target_env = \"msvc\")]\r\n    {\r\n        let linker_flags = [\"/MANIFEST:EMBED\", \"/MANIFESTINPUT:starship.exe.manifest\"];\r\n        for flag in linker_flags {\r\n            println!(\"cargo:rustc-link-arg={}\", flag);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2022-02-15T12:00:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-15T12:00:13Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/3590#discussion_r806755976",
