    "body": "Indeed...\r\n\r\nIt should be OK if you are not going to ever build with GCC or cross compile for Windows. Which might be fine here. We can also use `/MANIFESTUAC` instead of specifying it in the input manifest in this case.\r\n\r\nYou won't be able to include other kinds of resources that way though.",
