    "body": "I think some people were using the GNU toolchain, so it would be better to support `windows-gnu`. Supporting it will require scripting `windres` which shouldn't be too hard, most of the complexity in other tools seems to be in locating MSVC `rc.exe`.\r\n\r\nInstead of custom code, [windres](https://crates.io/crates/windres) also looks like a good alternative to embed-resource, but it's much less popular. [embed-manifest](https://crates.io/crates/embed-manifest) takes an approach that matches my snippet for MSVC, but the code for `windows-gnu` is scary.\r\n",
